    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Create a Line Chart\r\n\r\nThe `US_Gas_Prices.csv` dataset has been imported as `chart_one_data`. Ask AI Tutor to help you build a line chart showing how the U.S. average gas price changes over time.\r\n\r\nYour chart should:\r\n\r\n- Use `Date` for the x-axis and `US Average` for the y-axis.\r\n- Include a meaningful title and axis labels.\r\n- Display when the program runs.\r\n\r\nRun the program and review the chart. If something is incorrect, describe the problem to AI Tutor and revise the code.",
    "ai_tutor_available": "false",
